	<ThingDef ParentName="BaseWildTerraweapon">
		<defName>ET_SoulbloomRifle</defName>		<!--Counterpart: Prima OLR-->
		<label>soulbloom rifle</label>
		<description>A weapon patterned into stone rather than wood, and utilizing exotic crystal growths as ammunition source. This rifle is an extreme divergence from other Terratech weapons, but the fundamentals behind it's design remain the same.
\n\nUnlike organic weapons, soulbloom weapons do not expire over time; rather, their frames can survive a long time, but their crystal growths will need to be replenished. This can be done by crystal transplants, or by dousing them in potent saps.
\nThe soulbloom has no known sap or other infusion ability, but it's stronger projectiles allow it to output much more sustained damage when compared to it's organic counterparts.</description>
		<graphicData>
			<texPath>Things/WeaponSoulbloom/ET_SoulbloomRifle</texPath>
			<graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
			<drawSize>1.2</drawSize>
		</graphicData>
		<soundInteract>Interact_Rifle</soundInteract>
